---
description: Cinnabar CKB contracts. Follow AGENTS.md when editing Cargo.toml or contract sources.
globs:
  - "**/Cargo.toml"
  - "contracts/**"
  - "calculator/**"
  - "tests/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) before writing or changing a Cinnabar contract, calculator, or test.

- Scaffold from `templates/contract`. The `ckb-cinnabar-scripts-template` repository is deprecated; treat it as archived.
- On-chain code is a `cinnabar_main!` verification tree in `contracts/`. Off-chain code is an `Instruction` of `Operation`s in `calculator/`.
- `intent::*` only when the hop is exactly Create, Transfer, or Burn. Otherwise use a domain string and `Instruction::new`.
- Accept work only when `make build` and the full `make test` both exit 0.
- Do not add Capsule or `deployment.toml`. Deploy with `ckb-cinnabar --json --dry-run`.
- Error codes are in `docs/error-codes.md`. Custom codes start at 20.
